seal assurance kit
Copyright (c) 2026 Ben Cassie

This product vendors the public seal kernel and its browser glue from the
seal-check project (Apache-2.0):
  kernel/kernel.js, kernel/seal-config.js, kernel/wasm/seal.js, kernel/wasm/seal.wasm

The compiled kernel (seal.wasm) is the audited public build; its sha256 is pinned
in kernel/kernel.js (KERNEL_WASM_SHA256) and checked on every `seal verify` run.
All decision semantics live inside that compiled kernel. The kit adds only the
Node runner, the receipt verifier, and the CLI.
